  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>P</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;System of equations&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;has infinitely many solutions.</p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Also&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>174</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Two solutions are only possible.</p><p>Hence, set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;contains exactly two elements.</p>",
